Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.20,0:22:34.24,sign_32339_416_Antsy___,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(545,45)}Antsy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.24,0:22:38.68,italicstop,,0,0,0,,The truth is I love you, \Nbut I keep beating around the bush
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.68,0:22:43.58,italicstop,,0,0,0,,We're both the awkward type that'll try to \Nbrush it off as a joke (so much pressure)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.58,0:22:47.35,italicstop,,0,0,0,,Sigh... Getting this exhausted \Nover nothing is so stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.35,0:22:52.09,italicstop,,0,0,0,,We'll never move forward or get \Nany answers that way, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.09,0:23:00.94,italicstop,,0,0,0,,Now you're suddenly grumpy, why all the \Nswirling emotions? I sense rain coming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.14,0:22:54.01,sign_32339_416_Antsy___,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs16\pos(555,166)\fad(250,1)}Smoosh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.94,0:23:10.15,italicstop,,0,0,0,,You can have my umbrella, \Njust don't cry or get all mad and soaked
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.15,0:23:14.26,italicstop,,0,0,0,,Ah, my broken heart and \Nbroken body are at odds
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.26,0:23:18.94,italicstop,,0,0,0,,I guess I can't deal with this \Nunless I put armor on, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.94,0:23:22.89,italicstop,,0,0,0,,Constantly losing and being bewitched, \Nall at your mercy, is just frustrating
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.89,0:23:28.52,italicstop,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna solve the riddle of \Nthis impatient, shattering love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.86,0:23:30.30,italics,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,305)}(Grinding, throbbing)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.30,0:23:34.96,italicstop,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I might be a bit \Ntangled in my own web now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:38.94,italicstop,,0,0,0,,But once I find my courage, \Nyou'll see pure lo-love
